/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 280 0 R
/T (Any one can do astronomy! It is one of the most accessible hobbies as everyone has access to the night sky! It can be overwhelming getting into astronomy with all of its own scientific terms and endless options of optics to choose from. This guide was made as a tool to share some knowledge about astronomy as well as an organized sheet to refer to when first learning about astronomy. )
/E (Any one can do astronomy! It is one of the most accessible hobbies as everyone has access to the night sky! It can be overwhelming getting into astronomy with all of its own scientific terms and endless options of optics to choose from. This guide was made as a tool to share some knowledge about astronomy as well as an organized sheet to refer to when first learning about astronomy. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
316 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 280 0 R
/T (Science communication is a very important tool that can  inspire people to learn and get involved with science. Because science can be hard to comprehend on its own, and because some sources are hard to sift through, I belive it is important to have outreach and documents like this to bridge the gap and help people understand important concepts.)
