/P 291 0 R
/E (Maksutov-Cassegrain telescopes are very nice quality scopes that will bring higher contrast and sharpness in details of the objects you are observing. They do come only in limited amounts of sizes around 4 inches to 7 inches as the glass making for the corrector plate and curved mirror can be difficult to make. If you have the funds and the time, there are some small businesses out there that dedicate their skills to making bigger high quality maksutov-cassegrain telescopes!)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [10]
>>
