<<
/Title (Any one can do astronomy! It is one of the most accessible hobbies as everyone has access to the night sky! It can be overwhelming getting into astronomy with all of its own scientific terms and endless options of optics to choose from. This guide was made as a tool to share some knowledge about astronomy as well as an organized sheet to refer to when first learning about astronomy.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1653 0 R
/Next 1987 0 R
>>
endobj
1860 0 obj
<<
/Title (NOTE: This is a simple guide to organize tons of information because it can be hard to retain it all when you are first starting out. Of course there are many more brands and extensive things to know about astronomy that has not been included in this document and is based on my personal expirence in the field.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1653 0 R
/Prev 1987 0 R
>>
